                            fragmentPath="/content/dam/weekender-shared/en/adventures/gastronomic-marais-tour/gastronomic-marais-tour"
                            text="Gastronomic Marais Tour The Marais is one of the oldest quarters of Paris: narrow streets, hidden courtyards, and more good food to the square metre than almost anywhere in the city. With a guide who lives and shops here, a group of six at most spends the day tasting its way from bakery to cheese shop to market, and learns why each address is the one the neighbours choose."
